#21200
The Outer Gate of the Bastion~
   A gate a hundred feet high, of black iron studded with skulls, stands
open in the fortress wall. Its towers are lost in mist. An endless column of
grey soldiers marches out through it, east, toward the living. Nobody stops
you as you walk in against the stream; nobody has ever walked in before.
~
