#21201
The Killing Yard~
   A vast yard of black flagstones inside the gate, ringed by walls with
archers on every merlon. Grey legions drill here in silence, thousands at a
time. The flagstones are stained in patterns, the marks of every test the
Bastion's soldiers must pass.
~
