#21202
The War-Forge~
   A forge so large it has its own weather: hot winds, a rain of sparks, a
thunder of hammers. Grey iron from the Shattered Peaks is forged here into
the armour of the dread legions. The Forge-General oversees it from a
platform of black iron, and every blade is tested on a prisoner.
~
