#21203
The Beast Pens~
   Cages of black iron hold the war-beasts of the West: dread hounds,
wyverns, things that have no names. The air stinks of musk and blood. The
Beastmaster walks among the cages with a whip of chains, and the beasts
flinch from him.
~
