#21204
The Inner Court~
   A courtyard of black stone at the heart of the Bastion, overlooked by a
tower that rises out of sight. Statues of Nu'Groth's generals stand around
it, each one a monument to a kingdom destroyed. The newest plinth stands
empty, waiting. Its inscription reads MIDGAARD.
~
