#21205
The Prison of Heroes~
   Cells line a long black gallery, and in each one is a hero of the living:
a paladin, a queen, a wizard, a knight, all taken alive in battle. They are
not hollowed. They are kept, and every day the Warden of Chains asks each of
them to kneel. Most of them still refuse.
~
