#21206
The Chapel of the West~
   A chapel with no altar, only a window facing west, filled with a darkness
that moves. Nu'Groth's priests kneel before it, faces pressed to the floor.
The darkness in the window looks back at you, and for a moment you feel the
full weight of its attention, and your knees begin to bend.
~
