#21207
The War Room~
   A great hall around a table carved as a map of the whole realm. Grey
figures representing armies are placed upon it: the Last Light encircled,
the fens overrun, the Marches burning, Midgaard surrounded. The generals of
the West stand around the table, moving the pieces, and they look up as one.
~
