#21208
The Herald's Tower~
   At the top of the tower, in a hall open to the sky on the western side,
stands the Iron Herald, voice and general of Nu'Groth, armoured in black
iron fused to its body. It was the first and greatest of Nu'Groth's
champions, and it speaks with Nu'Groth's voice.
~
