#21209
The Inner Gate~
   At the western end of the Bastion a narrow gate of black stone opens onto
nothing: a grey haze, a sense of distance that does not match the space. The
air ripples like heat. The soldiers do not use this gate. Beyond it,
Nu'Groth's will is felt in every breath.
~
